# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context root's
# .dockerignore, which is what lets the dashboard build from the repository
# root even though the root file excludes apps/ and docs/ for the agent image.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the trees this build actually needs are
# re-included. An allowlist rather than a denylist: the repository root is
# ~6,300 files across training runs, vendored SDKs and model artefacts, and a
# denylist silently grows stale as new ones land.
*

!apps/sak_agent_dashboard
!docs
!personas
!services

# Re-excluded inside the allowed trees.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
apps/sak_agent_dashboard/.git
personas/*/skills/.archive
